 kit release - tags HEAD as a release and pushes the tag

   <version> required  the version to release: 0.1.0, or 0.1.0-rc.7 for a pre-release

   --lower             confirms a version not higher than the primary remote's highest release

   --wait              then waits that long, at most, for every pull source to serve it: 30m, 2h, or
                       1d


 kit release
